      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To start, ask the 1st Level Support if there is an issue."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening phrase implies process initiation (init:i1) and a generic start step (action:n1), while the remainder maps directly to action:n2."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3",
        "guard:b1->n4",
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the issue is resolved, provide feedback for the account manager."
      ],
      "justification": "action:n3 evaluates the condition, branch:b1 models the XOR split, guard:b1->n4 represents the positive/resolved path, and action:n4 executes the stated consequence."
    },
    {
